  abstract={Summary <p>This Chapter establishes the profit calculation model of power grid enterprises and analyzes the influences of the break&#x2010;even point (BEP) power sales quantity, the profit, the tax amount per unit power sales quantity, and the changes in other factors on profits; puts forward the calculation models of link electricity price under simple and complicated electric supply structures, and expounds the calculation of balanced energy flow and capital flow among links of generation, transmission, distribution and sales by taking a regional network as an example; introduces the types of electricity price, and analyzes the electricity price model under the single electricity purchaser model and possible ways for controlling the level of average unit price of power sales; builds a multi&#x2010;section electricity price model among the links of generation, transmission, distribution, and sales and provides recursion formulas on the condition of maintaining a balance between energy flow and capital flow; calculates the multi&#x2010;section electricity prices by taking the annual electric quantity data of a city as an example, and calculates and analyzes the changes in multi&#x2010;section electricity prices when the average unit price of power sales is decreased by 5%; and describes the policy of coal&#x2013;electricity price linkage and the upper limit methods generally applied internationally, and presents on&#x2010;grid price calculation formulas under changes in multiple factors, concluding through relevant analysis that, as power generation enterprises improve management, the effect where the reduction of the fixed cost per unit energy results in a lower on&#x2010;grid price will be increasingly weaker. Considering the influence of price markup at the power sales end on the post project evaluation, this chapter also puts forward the calculation formula of reverse allocation of price markup to transmission and distribution links, and the given calculation example shows that the calculation result satisfies the capital balance condition.</p>},
